00:56.585 --> 01:02.910
When the world is spinning out of my control

01:03.411 --> 01:08.015
You're the one true thing that I can't hold

01:10.028 --> 01:13.611
Through the static and the driving rain You're

01:13.651 --> 01:19.555
the one who keeps me sane You are the shelter You

01:19.976 --> 01:25.940
are the truth My anchor in this crazy youth

01:31.084 --> 01:38.681
