01:59.236 --> 02:06.178
But when the world is spinning out of my control

02:06.698 --> 02:11.300
You're the one true thing that I can't hold

02:13.380 --> 02:16.942
Through the static and the driving rain You're

02:16.962 --> 02:22.723
