03:19.818 --> 03:24.521
Cause when the world is spinning out of my

03:24.641 --> 03:30.304
control You're the one true thing that I can't

03:30.324 --> 03:36.005
hold Go through the static and the driving rain

03:36.645 --> 03:40.147
You're the one who keeps me sane You are the

03:40.207 --> 03:46.690
